DEVICE SPIKE

# STRIDE LAB - one-motor approximate straight-line linkage.
# Reset before repeating. Motor A drives only the 16 mm crank.
# The 40 mm coupler and 40 mm rocker constrain the tip geometrically.
# The tip's working stroke is nearly straight; its return follows an arch.
# A steady motor setting does not imply a constant tip speed.
WHEN flag clicked:
  set motor stop action A hold
  set motor speed A 5
  run motor A clockwise 720 degrees
  wait 2 seconds
  run motor A counterclockwise 720 degrees
  wait 2 seconds
